  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced capacity of tripartite constituents to promote compliance, improve OSH and eliminate worst forms of child labour through social dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the ILO&#x2019;s Programme of Support for Syria, this intervention aims to strengthen labour market governance and rights at work by improving labour administration policies and frameworks, including labour inspection and OSH systems, in line with international labour standards. The work will support the Ministry of Social Affairs and Labour and tripartite constituents to assess current gaps, update relevant national policies, and develop practical recommendations for reform. It will also reinforce social dialogue, improve institutional capacity, and support evidence-based policy development for safer, more compliant and better governed workplaces, with special attention to high-risk sectors and gender-responsive implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
